'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a set of [[medium armor]] in ''[[Helldivers 2]]''.

== Acquisition ==
Both the body armor and [[helmet]] can be claimed from page one of the [[Control Group Premium Warbond#Page 1|Control Group]] Premium [[Warbond]] for {{Currency|Medals|45|notext}} and 30 [[Medal]]s, respectively.

== Passive Ability ==
{{Armor Passive Info Panel|Adreno-Defibrillator}}

== Trivia ==
The studs on the helmet and especially on the pauldrons seem to be inspired by "molecular bonding studs" that feature on various designs of Warhammer 40,000 [https://megalodon.jp/2026-1105-2204-37/https://warhammer40k.wiki.gg:443/wiki/Space_Marines Space Marine] armor, most prominently on Mark V "Heresy Armour"

